or often asks Noa and her family to take Tomas for walks. The two are so close to each other that Noa often brushes his hair and feeds him in the morning and at night. Full of energy and a glutton for food. He is also mischievous, eating Nodachi's (Noa’s) Daifuku and getting chased by her. He also seems not to be very shy, as evidenced by the fact that he immediately took to Kazuhiro. He also seems to be a rather intelligent dog, as he is skilled at negotiating and calming Nodachi's (Noa’s) anger and making her give up."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c141366"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/10037ab6227f079f426c96e7bdc84db46098e13baf0e2886052b44030abb83fd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5b53b3058e9bbc6521db2fb4078c39728dc0fbe572774fe66765919769f5fba0.webp","width":142,"height":180,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c141412","characterName":"Ikumi","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c141412"},"originalCharacterName":"Ikumi","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young woman whom Kazuhiro used to keep company when he was younger."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c141412"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b92566feda3bb6b6cf7b629c9f8b83e2d6867d98ef61dfccba0b5a45ed17402b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/55d6d92db13de71c0bc308140fb5739a455ef135e83838c7c8753b428364865c.webp","width":256,"height":192,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c145728","characterName":"おにーちゃん","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c145728"},"originalCharacterName":"おにーちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A childhood promise, a bond between two people"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Memories from their childhood, proof that the two of them met - the doll that Kokone had always had was a \"big brother\" who would come to pick her up someday. When she lost her parents, when she was bullied, Kokone didn't cry because her big brother was by her side. Then, several years later, they met again by chance on the way to school in the morning. But he didn't remember Kokone. So she returned her precious treasure to her big brother. If he understood the meaning of this doll, he would definitely remember. She returned the doll with all the feelings Kokone had ever had."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c145728"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9ba4fc17563e42fbaa46fdea44e6e61549c7d86fe99258980d7eba73995889ba.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/55586a176ab01a1e7fe71d53b8bf84c96b7f446854d3b6a9674d9605b21bd11b.webp","width":256,"height":250,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c160688","characterName":"貴島 カナミ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c160688"},"originalCharacterName":"貴島 カナミ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kazuhiro’s little sister. Still residing with their mother she often calls to check in on him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c160688"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c160999","characterName":"貴島 お母さん","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c160999"},"originalCharacterName":"貴島 お母さん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kazuhiro’s mom, she calls him to offer advice ever so offer. Only appears via phone calls."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c160999"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c59188","characterName":"小菅 奈穂","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c59188"},"originalCharacterName":"小菅 奈穂","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"421"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A slightly out-of-focus honor student trying her best"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the first girl at Sakurai Academy that Kazuhiro met after completing the transfer procedures. She showed him around the academy. Although she has a slightly off-kilter sensibility, she has an extremely kind personality, and loves doing all kinds of housework and playing with children. She is a hard worker who handles a variety of tasks without complaint, but it is hard to shake the impression that she is being taken advantage of by some of the teachers. Although she just wants everyone to be happy, some of her classmates seem to find her behavior annoying. She has excellent grades and attends Sakurai Academy as a scholarship student. This may also be the reason why some people envy her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59188"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/85/8572a619348e4ce2a006dcef800c0297e91509c7b71df4b8fc2e84fb75edb2db.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/06bd902920a80dd5c5ba2545c2907e781e70f5804359a64c5f6451f5e6175ab1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c59322","characterName":"香咲 乃逢","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c59322"},"originalCharacterName":"香咲 乃逢","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"613"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"153"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A cheerful and independent stayer girl"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the only first-year member of Sakurai Academy's long-distance track and field team. Full of energy, she loves running and eating delicious food (especially sweets) more than anything else. Her cheerful personality has made her popular with the track and field team, other sports teams, and cheer squad members. However, because she is so laid-back, she often loses track of time and lets her mind wander. She doesn't care about records or competitive results, so she never takes part in competitions. She is good friends with Toma, a Labrador retriever kept next to her, and they often go on walks together."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59322"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d3181efb236ff37072396151aab6f166d95b6419681ab1e51b094cf025f85dd9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/28/28e23f402935764d49f49b1125191b9a71962823214f493fbfd0cf8f52e9e07f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"草柳 順子","creatorId":"vndb:s631","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s631","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s631","name":"中田 順子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:6860","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c59336","characterName":"望月 綾芽","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c59336"},"originalCharacterName":"望月 綾芽","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1212"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"77"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A lonely, cynical, cool beauty"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A classmate of Kazuhiro's. She left a strong impression on Kazuhiro from the moment they first met. She is a girl who lacks reality, and to put it better, exudes a mysterious aura. She always speaks and acts in a way that distances her from others, which makes her an outcast in class. Because of this, she is often alone, and outside of class she is often seen reading in her seat in the classroom, in the library, or on the roof of the annex where no one comes. She is the daughter of a wealthy man in town, and although many people blatantly slander her out of jealousy, she doesn't seem to mind at all. Although she never shows it on the surface, she is also a girl who is kinder than most."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59336"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/539a661728d792731a598fc2465ab134801f88c9602b62de02f6a4e4433edfab.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/65/65dcc027f174ef21f151d48426c3d878c251558e0aca54f8c3ab54162385ea25.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青山 ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:6858","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c59340","characterName":"芹沢 心音","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c59340"},"originalCharacterName":"芹沢 心音","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"825"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"155"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A spoiled little sister who has always had honest feelings for me"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When they met on the way to school in the morning, Kokone's lonely eyes left a strong impression on Kazuhiro. However, as they gradually became more comfortable with each other, her true, slightly childish, innocent and pure brightness began to emerge. Kokone clings to Kazuhiro and calls him \"Big Brother\". Even so, it can be sensed that she is careful not to cause him any trouble. Having lost her parents at an early age, she was raised by her grandparents. Despite her appearance, she is surprisingly strong-minded, which is probably due to her good upbringing. One morning after they met, Kokone hands Kazuhiro a boy's doll. What was she thinking at that moment."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59340"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/41d06b27b141f829b55c441096c3a4235b1051662fed4353da99be7073130f2c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/eb82aca4f7ace1e490134bcadb9d46268765d9e1d7854680bbdd1cf6ecbb8754.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"乃田 あす実","creatorId":"vndb:s1182","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1182","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1182","name":"韮井叶","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:6861","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c59341","characterName":"深月 遙","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c59341"},"originalCharacterName":"深月 遙","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"307"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"95"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"166"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The most popular teacher in the school just loves playing the piano"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is the music teacher and assistant homeroom teacher for Class 2-5, where Kazuhiro Kijima has transferred. She often takes over homeroom in place of their homeroom teacher, Kodama, who is not very enthusiastic outside of class. A beautiful woman with a nice body, she has a bright and friendly personality, which makes her very popular among the students. In this respect, she is the complete opposite of Mr. Kodama. Is it too much to say that her slightly childish personality is part of her cuteness? Although she is a skilled pianist, having attended a music college in the country, she can sometimes be more modest than necessary. However, she does love playing the piano. It's not that she's good at it, but rather that playing the piano is fun in itself. That's the kind of teacher she is."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c59341"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f4/f4b2c5e2e149fedc14d4ce2940fc4bfa5741bbcbe8823af368eb83be473822c2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/4463650b1f8bdadaf7f1e558e9f72f79eadb12a304f70ef4f7a8f6a5f94c8535.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西田 こむぎ","creatorId":"vndb:s570","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s570","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s570","name":"和田 カヨ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:6859","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c67840","characterName":"及川 譲","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c67840"},"originalCharacterName":"及川 譲","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"My first friend is a reliable loner with a sense of justice."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A male classmate of Kazuhiro's in class 5 of the 2nd grade. On the opening day of the new semester, he and Kazuhiro had an unlucky collision on their way to school. He and Kazuhiro had an unfortunate collision on the first day of the new school year, which led to their friendship. He has excellent grades and high athletic ability, but does not participate in club activities. He is a loner in his class. For unknown reasons, he does not get along with his parents, which seems to have cast a shadow over Oikawa's personality. He has known Naho Kosuge since they were in the second year of junior high school. They have maintained a mysterious relationship, neither close nor estranged. While Oikawa looks at Naho with his characteristic wary gaze, he may envy the existence of Naho, who \"lives alone\" without depending on anyone."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67840"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/4629434a0d87f91858a44899e4a34459de6886926e439bc37803473c254f4f34.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2e05bcfc634f57c762328d15f458a09f02a341825bf589a79b5bd57c14c25620.webp","width":230,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c67841","characterName":"児玉 忠","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c67841"},"originalCharacterName":"児玉 忠","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kazuhiro's homeroom teacher for Class 5, Year 2. He is in charge of physics. He is also the advisor for the girls' track team, but she is an aspirant in name only and rarely shows up for practice or even for competitions. He is a typical hard man, and his only criterion for evaluating students is their grades. He is overbearing toward students, but is low-ranking and authoritarian toward his superiors, such as the principal. He is obsessed with students' grades. It would be an unwise guess to assume that he is particularly concerned about the grades of his own class because that may be the standard by which the school evaluates its teachers, rather than the future of its students."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67841"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/81/8111a7f7c67e394daa3783f2aaeff9a26c723a42c840ae7600f68c2b15d487c7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf3e10d3dc21cccd7a295aca6837bb3c59f995c64026e785c6ecda4d7644939c.webp","width":230,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c67842","characterName":"麻生 久遠","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c67842"},"originalCharacterName":"麻生 久遠","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"720"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"157"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A super-hyper girl who is heading straight for her dreams!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A classmate of Kazuhiro's. She is highly sensitive, energetic, and full of curiosity. She is good at talking, but also quick to act. She is blessed with a natural talent for the piano, and is seriously considering becoming a pianist in the future. Haruka, the music teacher, also recognizes Kuon's talent, and gives her private piano lessons after school and during breaks. Currently, in preparation for the autumn competition, she is giving piano lessons to her, ignoring her exam studies (!?). She devotes her days to studying hard at music. As a result, her grades are a disaster, especially her physics, which is simply disastrous. However, she is determined to pursue her dreams, despite Kodama's sarcasm. She has a very strong trust in Haruka, and her naturally cheerful nature makes it very clear that she enjoys her lessons. She is a good friend of Kazuhiro, who has recently started coming to the music room. Kuon has no doubt that he is coming to the music room to get Haruka."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67842"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/76fd196959e12d3c024c72ac63569d0e30e6651a5b6af17a875b19d5d543bb74.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e2e93369cd2d0e17bd957a1562a43bebc1bdee6201af19e34f83cfbe068d35aa.webp","width":230,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"北都 南","creatorId":"vndb:s113","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s113","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s113","name":"ひと美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:6856","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c67843","characterName":"蔵谷 孝子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c67843"},"originalCharacterName":"蔵谷 孝子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"917"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The only senior who watches over Noa with kindness"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a second-year student who belongs to the Sakurai Academy girls' track and field club's long-distance team, and Noda's only senior. She is very fond of Noda, who is bright, straightforward, and does things at her own pace. Although she can be strict as a senior in the club, she never pressures Noda and tries to have discussions with him. Currently, she is thinking of taking Noda to a tournament. She seems to know the reason why she doesn't want to participate in the tournament. As can be seen from her relationship with Noda, she has a strong sense of responsibility and a kind personality that is considerate of others, but because she is extremely shy, she often gives off a cold impression to people she meets for the first time. However, once the barrier between them is gone, she is a reliable girl who is considerate of others' positions."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67843"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2ec31ed5f89c5e06e133cde9d27f4407adb8dbed5a8ad9e85354b946f1518afb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1e/1e888a000f77bebd78f2a2fa8c5b13bcdd83494d3f53a52803f2da1743226233.webp","width":230,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"児玉 さとみ","creatorId":"vndb:s115","so